            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Even More Gestures 0.2.8

- Global controls now name the physical trackpad motion they monitor.
- Turning off a global gesture disables its affected rows in every app and clearly labels them “Disabled in Gestures.”
- Sidebar swipe controls now consistently govern the physical left or right swipe, including when sidebar direction is inverted.
]]></description>
